Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢 先生 多施舍一点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much,sir.Even great..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿主保佑你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God bless you,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.39,0:01:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十全十美的大好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a very perfect gentle Knight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你们日安 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day you all sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:16.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多施舍点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh filling my cup running over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:19.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你的善良人人皆知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May your sweetness never blush unseen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我感激不尽 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My gratitude knows no bounds sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是你们的奴仆 衰弱且卑贱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I sit your slave weak and despised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:31.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉·莎士比亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William Shakespeare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是啊 我在那儿 他也是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yeah,i was there.And so was he..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有福的人是精神上的贫乏者 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blessed are the poor in spirit,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:48.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有福的人是精神上的贫乏者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blessed are the poor in spirit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你们的是天国 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for yours is the kingdom of heaven sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《歪唇男人》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帮帮忙吧 救命 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!Help!Help!Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:49.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们半个月前就安排好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we arranged it two weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:51.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我的俱乐部用晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were to have supper at my club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他今天早上还跟我提过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did mention it to me this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在一位女士来电前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just before the lady called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:02:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪位女士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道她的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I don't know her name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那位女士来电后福尔摩斯先生就出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the lady called and Mr. Holmes went out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然那样 我得好好利用这个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case I shall have take advantage of an early night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得去开门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must answer the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能会有点线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might be a clue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望我没有打扰你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope I'm not being a nuisance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定不会在意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh he won't mind I'm sure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他心肠最好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's the kindest of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惠特尼太太想见你 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Whitney to see you Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯特 真让人意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kate,this is a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不让人愉快的意外 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a pleasant one I fear John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 赫德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来点茶吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps some tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太感谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be most welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅我带来这么多麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must forgive me for causing so much trouble...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点也不麻烦 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're causing us no trouble at all,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的助手告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your assistant told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在和福尔摩斯先生共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you were dining with Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到诊所去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I see you've been to the surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在你刚离开的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you had just left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如你所见 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well Mr. Holmes has disappeared without trace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就更不该麻烦你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really shouldn't bother you with my problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每隔一段时间 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Mr. Holmes disappears without trace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会销声匿迹一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at regular intervals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:16.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大可不必担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's really no cause for alarm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好奇倒会有点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only curiosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你为什么想见我呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why did you want to see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.33,0:04:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're ill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:24.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不该穿过整个伦敦来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should not be traveling across London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没生病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:30.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是艾萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Isa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果艾萨病了 我可以去你家拜访他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well if Isa is ill I can visit him at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也人间蒸发了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He too has disappeared without trace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该能猜到他在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can probably guess what he's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:47.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他又沉迷于他的烟瘾中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I imagine he's indulging his addiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鸦片？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这也不是第一次了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well he's done this before has he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:57.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么原因让这次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes this circumstance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:04:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此特别？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so very different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通常他这种放纵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well normally his orgies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都不会超过一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are confined to one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他早上出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He leaves the house in the morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上就会回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and returns in the evening,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.03,0:05:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苍白且非常虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pale and shattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而这次呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经有两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have not seen Isa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没见过艾萨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for forty-eight hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:26.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否知道他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well have you the remotest idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能去哪里了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he might be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:31.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an establishment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:34.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫黄金酒馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called the Bar of Gold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在上天鹅闸巷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Upper Swandam Lane,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信他在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe he is there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:41.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不敢一个人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I dare not go there alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 任何一个体面的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no,no,no respectable woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都不会只身走进那肮脏的小巷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would go within a hundred miles of that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}百里的范围内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}vile alley unaccompanied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:49.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你愿意跟我一起去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you come with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不 - 但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:52.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将独自前往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No I shall go there on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你先回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will go home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你的丈夫真的在你所想的那个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if you're husband is where you think he is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.76,0:05:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证在两小时内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guarantee to have him back with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:58.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会回到你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管我不敢想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I dare not imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他届时的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what state he'll be in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的茶 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your tea Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很抱歉 赫德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My apologies Mrs. Hudson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不用茶了 我要出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall not require tea,I'm going out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但惠特尼太太得来点茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Mrs. Whitney will take tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那福尔摩斯先生回来时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what am I to tell Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:19.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该如何告诉他呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should he return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就说我消失得无影无踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him I've disappeared without trace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麻烦你 车夫 到上天鹅闸巷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upper Swandam Lane please cabbie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我时常会思忖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sometimes wonder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}究竟男人是否会成熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whether men ever truly grow up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:50.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们似乎永远都长不大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem to remain little boys forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫德森太太 你有这样想过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wonder about that Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 惠特尼太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,Mrs. Whitney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:06:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从不这样想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wonder about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们总是需要我们在事后抚慰他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they always need us to kiss them better afterwards,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 用言语抚慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a matter of speaking of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会久留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've not come here to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来找一位朋友的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a friend of mine here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想找艾萨·惠特尼先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wish to speak to Mr. Isa Whitney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}艾萨？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几点了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's eleven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:08.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天星期几？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十九号 星期五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friday the nineteenth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还以为是星期三呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was Wednesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是星期三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Wednesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:21.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想吓唬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trying to frighten me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的妻子已经在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wife has been waiting for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:26.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等你两天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to return home for two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:28.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两天？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:29.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:33.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几个小时吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few hours perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three pipes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}four pipes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:46.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外面有辆马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a cab outside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在就得回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going home now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:49.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定得回吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你还在乎我们的友谊 你妻子的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you value my friendship. Your wife's love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:59.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的凯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh poor Kate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还得付钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还欠店主钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe the manager money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不必为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to pay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的自我毁灭而付钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your own destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:20.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快离开这个糟糕的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get out of this dreadful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你的手拿开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:35.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跑到这种鬼地方来干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What on earth are you doing in this den?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在处理自己的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going about my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:43.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的马车在外面？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a cab outside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快把他送回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pray send him home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已经受不了任何折腾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks too limp to get into any kind of mischief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 五分钟后见 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll see you in five minutes. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把这个给房子里的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give this to the lady of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那里见到你让我非常吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was certainly surprised to see you in that place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.21,0:12:47.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为除了那些小毛病外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose you think I've added opium to smoking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又开始吸鸦片了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to all of my other little weaknesses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我仅仅是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I merely said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那里见到你让我很吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was surprised to see you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:52.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见到你我也很吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As indeed I was to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在找一位朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was searching for a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:12:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在找一位敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I for an enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.95,0:12:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}敌人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An enemy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倘若在那里有人把我认出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had I been recognized in that place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:13:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的性命顷刻就会断送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my life would not of been worth an hours purchase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:02.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:05.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我身处在一个最不可思议的调查中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in the midst of the most remarkable inquiry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.91,0:13:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你没有吸那烟管里的东西 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope your not smoking the substance in that pipe Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只为了融入环境稍吸了一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only to the extent necessary to merge with the surroundings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要去肯特郡的李镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm off to Lee in Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.35,0:13:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在应该安全了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we shall be safe now Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:41.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿一下缰绳好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you take the reins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们到底去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where exactly are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}松园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cedars,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一栋漂亮的别墅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lovely villa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在肯特郡靠近李镇的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}near Lee in Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:55.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能否问一下 我为什么要在三月的星期五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask why I'm going to Lee in Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}半夜三更的 跑到肯特郡的李镇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of the night? On a Friday in March?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你是我值得信赖的伙伴以及忠诚的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you are my trusty comrade and my loyal friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可能两样都需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may need both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我掌握的一些情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here are the facts,as I understand them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.15,0:14:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几年前 有位叫内维尔·圣克莱尔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Several years ago there came to Lee in Kent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绅士来到肯特郡的李镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a gentleman by name Neville St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:13.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他购置了一栋大别墅 叫松园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took a large villa,The Cedars,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:15.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大约一年后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and about a year later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}娶了当地一家酿酒商的女儿为妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}married the daughter of a local brewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在有两个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have two small children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在几家公司里都有股份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has interests in several companies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天早上进城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and travels to the city every morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天晚上在坎农街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}returning by the 5:14 train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乘五点十四分的火车回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Cannon Street every night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他没有不良爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a man of temperate habits,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一位好丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a good husband,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}慈爱的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an affectionate father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在朋友间很受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is popular with all who know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:41.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的负债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His debts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迄今为止我们所能查明是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as far as we can ascertain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}八十八磅十先令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}amount to eighty-eight pounds and ten shillings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而其在首都郡县银行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while he has two hundred and twenty pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:48.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}账户上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to his credit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:50.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有两百二十磅存款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the Capital and Counties Bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.17,0:14:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 没有理由认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore,there is no reason to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他存在财务上的困扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that money troubles have been weighing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蹩脚的模仿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manageable parody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的话中有一丝怀疑的语气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's a hint of skepticism in your voice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可对你没什么好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which does you no credit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想圣克莱尔太太告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect Mrs. St.Clair came to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的丈夫失踪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saying that her husband has disappeared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来这成为生活中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well seems to be a continuous thread{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:10.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可或缺的部分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in life's fabric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,what is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将忽略你对社会缺陷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall ignore your air of resignation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:17.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听之任之的态度 继续介绍案情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the world's frailties and continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh please do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On Monday,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔如平常一样进城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}St. Clair left for the city as usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他临走前答应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before he left he promised that he would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给孩子们带一盒积木\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring home a box of building bricks for his children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}积木？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Building bricks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.73,0:15:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好记下来 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark that well Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他走后不久 圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon after he left,Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收到一封电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}received a telegram{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说在亚伯丁运输公司的办事处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to say that a parcel of considerable value{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:41.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一件寄给她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had arrived for her at the offices{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相当昂贵的包裹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Aberdeen Shipping Company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:46.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她决定进城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She decided to travel to the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.41,0:15:47.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收取包裹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}collect her parcel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吃午饭并进行购物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have lunch and do some shopping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她意外地发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was by chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:16:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自己走到了上天鹅闸巷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that she found herself in Upper Swandam Lane,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那条我们今晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that same vile alley{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都拜访过的肮脏的小巷 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we both visited this evening,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而正在此时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was at this point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:10.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一件非常奇怪的事情发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that something quite singular took place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(穷困的人)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请施舍点钱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:21.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neville!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neville!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.19,0:17:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想上哪去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.31,0:17:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要上楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见到我的丈夫在楼上招手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw my husband waving from an upstairs window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nobody upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:50.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认得自己的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know my own husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他来这里干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nobody upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:18:00.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neville!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.53,0:18:01.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们把她赶出去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they threw her out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:04.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个马来人和印度人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The malay and the lascar,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是那栋房子的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who owns the establishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个劣迹昭彰的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man of the vilest antecedents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:12.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把一个杀人凶手放进了酒馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sent a murderer into the bar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杀人凶手？却没有受到制裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A murderer?Yet he goes free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.93,0:18:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房子的后屋向着河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rear of a building backs onto the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那甚至还有一扇活板门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's even a convenient trap door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作抛弃尸体之用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the disposal of bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么警方不逮捕这两名杀人凶手呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't the police arrest these two murderers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:23.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 警方逮捕了一个瘸子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,the police have arrested a cripple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有很长的案情没给你介绍完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so much more yet to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:27.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们已经到达松园了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but here we are at The Cedars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有进展吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为你已经入睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd be asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:50.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这种时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep does not come easily{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想安然入睡并不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a time like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是我的朋友兼同事华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my friend and colleague Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}慷慨地答应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has kindly agreed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}协助我进行调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to help me in my investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生提起过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes has spoken of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我擅作主张请医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have taken the liberty of asking the doctor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在此处过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stay overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我擅作主张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I took the liberty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备了一顿冷晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of preparing a little cold supper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生你坐我的位置吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Doctor Watson you take my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}万万不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.39,0:19:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 圣克莱尔太太是位非常执着的女性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,Mrs. St. Clair is a very strong willed woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好不要冒险拒绝她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you refuse her at your peril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:24.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在用餐前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before we eat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想问你几个直截了当的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should like to ask one or two plain questions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:31.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望能得到坦率的回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to which I should like plain answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly Madame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打心底里认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you in your heart of hearts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔还活着吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think that Neville is still alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坦白回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我既不会歇斯底里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not hysterical{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不会晕厥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor am I given to fainting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那坦白地说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为他已经死了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think he is dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.09,0:19:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:19:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他是什么时候死的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on what day did he meet his death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.93,0:20:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那怎么解释我在今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So then how do you explain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期五 收到他的来信呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I received a letter from him today,being Friday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:35.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能否帮我个忙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if you would do me a favor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.91,0:20:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}竭尽所能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By all means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经将你被驱逐出那栋房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have told Doctor Watson what happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:43.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之前的案情向华生医生介绍过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up to the moment when you were ejected from that building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能告诉我们随后发生的事情吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you tell us what happened subsequently please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉华生医生吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Doctor Watson's benefit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得将所掌握的他们的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I too have to reexamine the facts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重新梳理一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as we know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你还不是太疲倦的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if you're not too tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以想象得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you may imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对被强行赶出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not take kindly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事是绝对无法容忍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to being forcibly removed from a building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我便寻求警察的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sought and found police help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几名巡佐和巡官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two constables and Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱斯特里特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradstreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:12.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱斯特里特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradstreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:14.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后你们返回那栋房子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you returned to the building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:17.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两次拜访间隔了多久？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The period of time between these two visits was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概二十分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About twenty minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:24.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们回去的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time we returned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:25.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门没有上锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the door was unbolted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:27.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定是那个印度人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I'm sure the lascar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:29.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我离开以后把锁打开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had bolted it when I left earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:35.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要检查你楼上的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to look at your upstairs rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果楼上没有人 你就没理由拒绝我检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's nobody there you can't object that I look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:40.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们俩留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You men stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就在这间房里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in this room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.49,0:21:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说过好多回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time and again I tell you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:21:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's nobody here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.59,0:22:01.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能检查一下那间房吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May we look in that room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不必担心这位男子 圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mustn't be worried by this gentleman,Mrs. St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.51,0:22:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是警察局的老朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an old friend of the constabulary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.75,0:22:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,Inspector,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.15,0:22:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据W·S·吉尔伯特所说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}according to W. S. Gilbert,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.89,0:22:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警察的生活不是愉快的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a policeman's life isn't a happy one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布恩先生是位职业乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Boone is a professional beggar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:33.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,not a beggar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是位诚实的商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an honest trader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.07,0:22:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他住在这里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this man lodge here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.40,0:22:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.45,0:22:43.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说没有人住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me nobody lived here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 这个乞丐算不上是人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madame,the beggar is nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们要是用刀剑刺我们 我们不是也会出血的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you prick us do we not bleed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:50.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莎士比亚 布恩先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shakespeare,Mr. Boone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.12,0:22:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道这句话 你以前跟我说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that one you've told it to me before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.49,0:22:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.19,0:23:03.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是泰晤士河 圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be the Thames Mrs. St Clair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:05.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是扇大窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the large window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户与河十分接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a window and a river in close proximity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并不必然与暴力致死划等号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does not automatically mean violent death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.45,0:23:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去一个小时你一直在这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You been here in the past hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.81,0:23:27.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有人来过这里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唉 没有 我如一朵流云独自在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alas,no,I've been as lonely as a cloud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.12,0:23:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}丁尼生(维多利亚时代最杰出的诗人)？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tennyson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:35.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华兹华斯(英国浪漫主义诗人) 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wordsworth,Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就站在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was standing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.94,0:24:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太 没有证据表明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. St. Clair there is no evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.15,0:24:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他曾经来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to suggest that he was ever here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:18.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}积木 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Building bricks,Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.61,0:24:20.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫今早进城前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband left for the city this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.84,0:24:25.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我说的最后一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the last thing he said to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.22,0:24:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是要给女儿买盒积木\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that he had to buy some building bricks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:29.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做生日礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for our little girl's birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.29,0:24:30.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.43,0:24:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们哪位买过积木？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either of you gentlemen buy building bricks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.10,0:24:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定是有人落在这的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody must have left them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.63,0:24:53.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是我丈夫的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these are my husband's clothes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.13,0:24:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.01,0:24:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你检查的时候需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I describe them to you in detail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.55,0:25:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}细细形容吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you examine them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.09,0:25:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫的裁缝名叫斯马德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband's tailor's name is Smud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.93,0:25:05.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你检查一下标签就会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you care to examine the label.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.85,0:25:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那时起 布莱斯特里特巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At that moment Inspector Bradstreet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:14.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}开始相信我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}began to believe my story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.59,0:25:15.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他和他的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He and his men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对那栋楼进行了地毯式搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made an extensive search of the building{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.11,0:25:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在窗台上发现了血迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they found a bloodstain upon the windowsill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.32,0:25:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们搜查了那个马来人 印度人和布恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They searched the malay,the lascar and Boone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.72,0:25:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但什么也没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but found nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.59,0:25:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们无法找到我丈夫的大衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They failed to find my husband's overcoat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.59,0:25:31.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.74,0:25:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大衣？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overcoat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.43,0:25:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唯一一件无法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one item of clothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.43,0:25:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找到的衣物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was not accounted for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.34,0:25:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到退潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until low tide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很重 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's heavy sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.36,0:26:05.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被什么东西坠得很沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weighted down with something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.84,0:26:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总共有四百二十一便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were four hundred and twenty-one pennies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.49,0:26:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两百七十半便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two hundred and seventy halfpennies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}塞满大衣的每个口袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stuffed into every pocket of the overcoat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.91,0:26:27.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的结论 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your conclusion Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.83,0:26:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你尽管说 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak freely Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.06,0:26:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去的一个星期里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lived with every possibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.34,0:26:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论多可怕的可能性我都想过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this past week however hideous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.65,0:26:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凶手一定是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The murderer must have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.87,0:26:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乞丐布恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boone the beggar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.95,0:26:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么人会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else could have access to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.05,0:26:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此大量的便士和半便士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}such a vast number of pennies and halfpennies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警方也是如此认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the conclusion reached by the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.97,0:26:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们逮捕了布恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've arrested Boone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.97,0:26:52.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在在船首街的警察局里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he is presently in Bow Street Police Station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.86,0:26:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管我的丈夫仍然活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though my husband is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.35,0:27:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.55,0:27:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们来重新考究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let us reexamine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.59,0:27:07.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这封信的重要性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the significance of this letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.86,0:27:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能给华生医生读一下吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I read it to Doctor Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.79,0:27:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By all means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.71,0:27:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 不要害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dearest,Do not be frightened,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出了一个极大的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is a huge error,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.45,0:27:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能需要一点时间纠正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which it may take some little time to rectify.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.44,0:27:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}耐心等待 内维尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait in patience. Neville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.03,0:27:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用铅笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Written in pencil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.01,0:27:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}写于书的空白页\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the flyleaf of a book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.23,0:27:29.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}八开的书 没有水印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}octavo size,no watermark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.95,0:27:34.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由一名拇指肮脏的男子于格雷夫森德寄出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Posted in Gravesend by a man with a dirty thumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.18,0:27:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是你丈夫的笔迹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not your husband's writing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.61,0:27:36.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.37,0:27:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这封短信是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the note is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.81,0:27:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.04,0:27:41.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是他匆忙时常用的笔迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the hand he always used when he was in hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给信封封口的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever gummed down the envelope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.06,0:27:47.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有正确地处理信封\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}handled this very much in error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.37,0:27:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有嚼烟叶的习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been chewing tobacco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.90,0:27:53.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个微不足道的细节 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a trifle,of course,Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.33,0:27:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但微不足道的细节最重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there is nothing so important as trifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.02,0:28:04.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.96,0:28:07.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信里还有个附件？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was an enclosure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的图章戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His signet ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.34,0:28:24.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:25.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你丈夫是否提起过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has your husband ever spoken of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.54,0:28:29.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 上天鹅闸巷的黄金酒馆？- 从未提起过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- the Bar of Gold in Upper Swandam Lane? - Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.38,0:28:30.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suspect that Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.46,0:28:32.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想问你一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a question to put to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.95,0:28:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个问题不好开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a difficult question to ask{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.01,0:28:40.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.03,0:28:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的丈夫有没有任何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but has your husband ever shown{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.98,0:28:44.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸食鸦片的迹象？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any signs of taking opium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.54,0:28:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他举止总是非常正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always appeared perfectly normal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.97,0:28:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我得坦白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though I confess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.77,0:28:57.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不懂辨认迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not recognize the signs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.54,0:28:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么迹象？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.30,0:29:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无精打采\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well a listlessness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缺乏活力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lack of energy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.09,0:29:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无法集中精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an inability to concentrate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对一切都缺乏兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a general air of apathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.58,0:29:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Watson is a specialist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.38,0:29:10.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无法控制的瘾疾很在行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at uncontrolled addiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.26,0:29:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫没有沉迷于鸦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband was not an opium addict,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.89,0:29:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换言之他不吸食鸦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's to say is not an opium addict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.12,0:29:24.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.65,0:29:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你认为我丈夫已经身亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you think my husband is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.83,0:29:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我完全意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fully realize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.71,0:29:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那封信可能写于星期一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that letter could have been written on Monday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是在今天才寄出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and only posted today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.67,0:29:35.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.09,0:29:36.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所列举的种种情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as they have been described{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都不可避免地得出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lead to the inescapable conclusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.65,0:29:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已被谋杀这一结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he has been murdered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.98,0:29:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但同样我也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but equally I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.06,0:29:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.77,0:29:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们之间有着紧密的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's such a keen bond of sympathy between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.25,0:29:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他遭遇不幸我会感应到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should know if evil came upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.91,0:29:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请帮我找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help me to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.33,0:30:41.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 如果内维尔·圣克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson if Neville St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.34,0:30:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还活着并且毫发无损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is alive and well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.65,0:30:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么不回家来证明这一点呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why doesn't he come home and demonstrate the fact?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.20,0:30:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他可能已经不在人世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well presumably because he's not alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.42,0:30:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 但这封信呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes but this letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.35,0:30:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能写于任何时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could have been written at any time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:51.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能写于极度痛苦之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps under distress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.56,0:30:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也可能是精心伪造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could even be a skillful forgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.60,0:30:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那这枚图章戒指呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this signet ring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.51,0:30:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很容易取下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easily removed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.74,0:30:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别是从一具尸体上取下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially if the victim is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.74,0:31:02.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.55,0:31:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回到内维尔·圣克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preceding on the hypothesis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.16,0:31:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经死了这一假设\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Neville St.Clair is dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.91,0:31:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是怎么死的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how did he meet his death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很明显是被谋杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well clearly he was murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.77,0:31:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被谁谋杀的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.69,0:31:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警方认为是那个叫布恩的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the police think it was this chap,Boone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.70,0:31:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我十分赞同警方的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see no reason to disagree with the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.67,0:31:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:22.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.78,0:31:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说他是个瘸子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say he's a cripple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.44,0:31:25.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.45,0:31:26.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的残疾有多严重？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How severe is his disability?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.00,0:31:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是有一点跛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has only a slight limp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的行医经验告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well my medical experience tells me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.47,0:31:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通常当一条腿有缺陷时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when there is a weakness in one limb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:34.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为补偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's very often compensated for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.65,0:31:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一条腿会变得非常健壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by exceptional strength in the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.64,0:31:41.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无法说服你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not convinced?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.90,0:31:45.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这名男子是个职业乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man is a professional beggar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.92,0:31:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在城里很出名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's well known in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.70,0:31:51.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也很受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's well liked in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.11,0:31:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见过他许多次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen him many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他巧舌如簧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a remarkable faculty for repartee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.56,0:31:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极能取悦施舍他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with which he delights his many clients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.09,0:31:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听起来没什么危害性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well he sounds harmless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.74,0:32:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然如此 警方为什么要逮捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why,therefore,did the police arrest him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.06,0:32:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是那个印度人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rather than the lascar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.25,0:32:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正是我向巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the very question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.43,0:32:06.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱斯特里特提出的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I put to Inspector Bradstreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.42,0:32:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用排除法可以肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The murder has obviously been committed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.11,0:32:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凶案肯定发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by process of elimination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.80,0:32:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布恩一定是凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boone must be the murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.20,0:32:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是内维尔·圣克莱尔的衣服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are these Neville St. Clair's clothes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.95,0:32:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么排除了那名印度人的嫌疑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you eliminate the lascar as a suspect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.75,0:32:31.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为圣克莱尔太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Mrs. St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.30,0:32:32.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见到她丈夫在楼上的一扇窗户旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saw her husband in an upstairs window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.86,0:32:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正在与人搏斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}apparently in the middle of a struggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.13,0:32:35.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她从楼下的门进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She went to a downstairs door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.53,0:32:37.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被印度人拦住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was confronted by the lascar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.48,0:32:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当她在跟我们讲述时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While we were conversing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:42.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更确切的说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or to be more precise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.23,0:32:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当那个印度人和他的助手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while the lascar and his assistant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.22,0:32:45.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将圣克莱尔太太赶出门时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were ejecting Mrs. St. Clair from the building{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.94,0:32:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上的搏斗仍未停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the fight was proceeding upstairs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.48,0:32:49.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且导致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leading as we now know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.49,0:32:51.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔·圣克莱尔的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the death of Neville St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.65,0:32:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}二十一岁的生日礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A twenty first birthday present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.17,0:32:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极其注意细节的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man of meticulous habits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.09,0:32:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有划痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No scratches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.87,0:33:00.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀圣克莱尔的动机是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the motive in killing St. Clair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.32,0:33:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有待调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That remains to be established.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.27,0:33:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有鸦片的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a trace of opium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.96,0:33:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有可能是抢劫吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could it have been robbery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.38,0:33:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.56,0:33:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔的钱包还在口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}St. Clair's wallet was in his pocket,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.52,0:33:15.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}分文未少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the money untouched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.74,0:33:23.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么解释大衣里的硬币？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you explain the coins in the overcoat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.60,0:33:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法回答 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot truly answer that Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.66,0:33:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.86,0:33:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布恩将圣克莱尔杀死后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boone killed St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.80,0:33:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脱去其外衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He removes the outer garments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.95,0:33:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}企图将衣服及衣服内的物品换成现金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hoping to capitalize on them and their contents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他抬起尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lifts the body,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.78,0:33:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿过房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}carries it across the room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.11,0:33:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将尸体推出窗口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forces it through the open window,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.10,0:33:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由此导致皮肤擦伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hence the abrasion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.24,0:33:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}血滴落在窗台上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}blood upon the windowsill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.30,0:33:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将尸体放入河中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he releases it into the river...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.06,0:33:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}潮水将尸体卷走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where it's sucked away by the tide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.04,0:34:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这一系列行为期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the midst of this activity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.28,0:34:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他听见圣克莱尔太太想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he hears the scuffle downstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.76,0:34:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强行闯入所发出的吵杂声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as Mrs. St. Clair tries to force her way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.56,0:34:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时间宝贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not a moment to be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.58,0:34:07.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须将衣物处理掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must dispose the clothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.72,0:34:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他从大衣着手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He starts with the overcoat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并马上意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He realizes,at once,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.91,0:34:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大衣不会沉入水中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will float and not sink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.23,0:34:19.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是怎么做的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so what does he do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.59,0:34:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他迅速穿过房间来到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He rushes across the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.09,0:34:25.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某个秘密藏宝地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to some secret hall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.38,0:34:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面均为其乞讨所得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he's accumulated the fruits of his beggary,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将所有能拿到的硬币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stuffs all the coins that he can lay his hands on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.31,0:34:32.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放进大衣的口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the pockets of the overcoat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.53,0:34:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后将其扔进河中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And drops it into the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.36,0:34:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你和你的手下没有赶到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And would presumably have done the same{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.20,0:34:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他的衣物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the other garments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.19,0:34:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也会落得同样的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you and your men had not arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.05,0:34:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将这些衣物藏到帘子后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conceals the other garments behind the curtain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.81,0:34:46.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望不会被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hopes they'll not be noticed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.22,0:34:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果不是圣克莱尔太太如此坚持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they would not have been noticed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.83,0:34:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}则会正中其下怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had Mrs. St. Clair not been so persistent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.67,0:34:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官 无论那个毒窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector,whatever plot has been hatched{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.34,0:34:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在酝酿何种阴谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in that opium den{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.59,0:34:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为那个印度人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot but imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:35:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都脱不了干系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the lascar is not somehow involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.55,0:35:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当天极想逮捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was sorely tempted to arrest him on the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.90,0:35:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在就派几个人过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll send a couple of men up there now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.25,0:35:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.74,0:35:11.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.46,0:35:15.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your permission,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.58,0:35:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以提出另外一个策略吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may I suggest an alternative strategy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.05,0:35:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By all means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.81,0:35:24.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我来拜访这个毒窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me visit the opium den{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.01,0:35:26.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谨慎低调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}discreetly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.62,0:35:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔装打扮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}incognito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.61,0:35:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就能得知我们想要知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall learn what we may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.79,0:35:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你有什么收获？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what did you learn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.00,0:35:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.15,0:35:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据我调查所知… 每一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody... as far as I can ascertain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都在说真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}appears to be telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.26,0:36:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法弄清总体情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot see an over all pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.20,0:36:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你呢 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see a pattern Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.05,0:36:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法弄清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see no pattern{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.11,0:36:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只见到一位女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I do see a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.20,0:36:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不顾所有的客观情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who despite all objective circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.34,0:36:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信她的丈夫仍然在世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still believes that her husband is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.28,0:36:21.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你多次说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you said on many occasions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.78,0:36:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位女士的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the impression of a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.33,0:36:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能远比分析推理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may be more valuable than the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:26.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所得的结论来得有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}conclusion of an analytical reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.45,0:36:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.45,0:36:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if he is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.65,0:36:40.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.81,0:36:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.80,0:36:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我却有个急迫的请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I do have an urgent request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.26,0:36:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在已经是凌晨四点多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's now well past four in the morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.36,0:36:50.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以睡了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may I go to sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.68,0:36:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:54.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.01,0:38:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.45,0:38:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.23,0:39:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几点了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.51,0:39:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拂晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.25,0:39:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我才睡了两个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only had two hours sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.64,0:39:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if you'd do me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.78,0:39:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好心帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the very great kindness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.97,0:39:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}考虑一下起个床呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of considering the possibility of waking up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.06,0:39:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你有个起床的好理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you have a good reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.31,0:39:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想一起跑一趟吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you game for a drive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.56,0:39:20.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.14,0:39:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但非得这么早吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it have to be this early?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.54,0:39:24.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想验证我的一个小设想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a little theory I wish to test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人命悬一线吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone's life at stake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.24,0:39:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.52,0:39:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以在早上的晚些时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would it be possible to test your theory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.73,0:39:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再验证你的设想吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little later this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.10,0:39:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}五分钟后楼下见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you downstairs in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.50,0:39:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.77,0:39:44.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出发 尼尔森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Nelson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.42,0:39:56.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在保持缄默方面真有天赋 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the grand gift of silence Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.92,0:39:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让你成为一位难能可贵的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes you quite invaluable as a companion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.53,0:40:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你正在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson you're in the presence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.81,0:40:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全欧洲最笨的笨蛋面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of one of the most absolute fools in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.32,0:40:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你太夸张了 福尔摩斯 - 在你起床的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You exaggerate Holmes. - I deserve to be kicked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.16,0:40:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就该被踢到查林克罗斯去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from here to Charing Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.61,0:40:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你叫醒我的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moment you woke me up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.62,0:40:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那我该准备好… - 我掌握事情关键了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would have been prepared to... - I've got the key Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.97,0:40:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在这个袋子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here in this Gladstone bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.99,0:40:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.83,0:40:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我得承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson I confess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.42,0:40:29.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟鼹鼠一样瞎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been as blind as a mole,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.66,0:40:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在学聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's better to learn wisdom later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.22,0:40:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总比不学好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than to never learn it at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.03,0:40:33.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱斯特里特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradstreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.86,0:40:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱斯特里特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradstreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.76,0:40:43.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经就那个乞丐布恩的事来电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've called about that beggar man,Boone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.17,0:40:44.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在监狱里 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in the cells Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能为你效劳吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.45,0:40:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很想见见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should very much like to see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.69,0:40:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他可能还在睡觉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd probably be asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.89,0:40:49.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝大多数人可能都在睡觉 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the population is probably asleep Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.84,0:40:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好 福尔摩斯 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well Holmes,Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.39,0:40:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you'll come this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.42,0:40:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能把你的袋子留在办公室吗 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can leave your bag in the office Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:55.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.84,0:40:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那里有关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It contains the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.68,0:41:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个肮脏的无赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a dirty scoundrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.24,0:41:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很肮脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Filthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.93,0:41:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不肯洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Refuses to wash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.27,0:41:06.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说洗澡会削弱人的抵抗力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Says washing weakens a man's resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.34,0:41:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.03,0:41:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他真是个美人 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a beauty isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.69,0:41:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官 烦请你尽可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector would you do me the great goodness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.93,0:41:24.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小声地将门打开 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of opening the door as quietly as possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.54,0:43:24.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 容我为你们介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,let me introduce you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.15,0:43:25.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自肯特郡李镇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Mr. Neville St. Clair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.68,0:43:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔·圣克莱尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Lee in the county of Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.68,0:43:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天老爷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great heaven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.29,0:43:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is true{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.30,0:43:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请问我被控何罪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pray what am I being charged with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.13,0:43:43.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被控谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charged with making away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.37,0:43:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔·圣克莱尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Mr. Neville St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.20,0:43:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀我自己？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well making away with myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.09,0:43:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当了二十七年警察了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been on the force for twenty-seven years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.15,0:43:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这回真是得奖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This takes the cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.16,0:43:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但很明显\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But since it is obvious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.80,0:44:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何凶案发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that no crime has been committed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.45,0:44:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是被非法拘留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am illegally detained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.25,0:44:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一人的力量胜于十人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My strength is the strength of ten{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.11,0:44:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因我心灵纯净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because my heart is pure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.62,0:44:15.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亚弗烈·丁尼生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred Lord Tennyson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.27,0:44:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你向你的妻子撒谎 圣克莱尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lied to your wife Mr. St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.90,0:44:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这也是纯净吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that purity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.22,0:45:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望你们理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it be understood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.70,0:45:25.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宁愿忍受牢狱之灾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I would have endured imprisonment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.51,0:45:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even execution,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.21,0:45:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不愿将我这个可耻的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rather than reveal my miserable secret{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.28,0:45:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}透露给我的妻儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to my wife and children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.83,0:45:37.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就现在透露 圣克莱尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All is now revealed Mr. St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.53,0:45:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.22,0:45:46.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲曾是切斯特菲尔德的教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was a schoolmaster in Chesterfield{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.25,0:45:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我受过良好的教育\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've received an excellent education.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.59,0:45:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}酷爱旅行和表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traveled,took to the stage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.89,0:45:56.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后成为伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and finally became a reporter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.98,0:45:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一家报社的记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a London newspaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.58,0:46:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一天 我的编辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day my editor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.72,0:46:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想要一系列关于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wished to have a series of articles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.40,0:46:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首都乞讨状况的报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}upon begging in the metropolis,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.34,0:46:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我自动请缨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I volunteered to supply them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.08,0:46:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此你成为一名乞丐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you became a beggar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.27,0:46:12.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.45,0:46:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你当演员的经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your experience as an actor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.36,0:46:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定大派用场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must have proved invaluable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.14,0:46:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.43,0:46:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.86,0:46:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给自己化妆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I painted my face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.41,0:46:27.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弄得自己一副可怜相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make myself look as pitiable as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.53,0:46:30.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还弄了骇人的伤疤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I manufactured frightening scars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.45,0:46:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我用肉色熟石膏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I twisted my lip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.00,0:46:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把嘴唇一边向上扭卷起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the aid of a piece of flesh colored plaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.95,0:46:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}戴上深色假发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then with a dark wig{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.09,0:46:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}配以合适的服装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and appropriate clothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.23,0:46:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在首都\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}took my position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最繁华的地方蹲点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the busiest part of the metropolis,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.98,0:46:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以卖火柴的名义 实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ostensibly as a match-seller but,yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.40,0:46:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一名乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}really as a beggar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.69,0:46:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你收入颇丰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you did well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.75,0:46:54.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.35,0:46:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一天之内讨到二十六先令和四便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In one day I took twenty-six shillings and four pence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.03,0:47:01.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为报社写了文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrote my articles for the newspaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.25,0:47:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的编辑很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My editor was delighted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.36,0:47:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也就再也没想过这件事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I thought no more about it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.08,0:47:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到有一天 我为一位朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until one day I backed a bill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.30,0:47:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}背书担保了一张票据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a friend of mine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.62,0:47:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来接到传票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had a writ served on me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.58,0:47:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我赔偿二十五镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for twenty-five pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.46,0:47:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我头脑一片空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I was at my wits end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.21,0:47:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean what could I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.99,0:47:21.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}突然计上心来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then suddenly an idea came to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.13,0:47:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向雇主请了两星期的假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked for a fortnight's holiday from my employers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.89,0:47:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在城里四处乞讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and spent the time in the city begging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.92,0:47:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不消十天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ten days I had the money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.65,0:47:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就筹够钱还债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was able to pay back the debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.41,0:47:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这时我就陷入了泥潭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was when I fell into the trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.64,0:47:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当时在报社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much were you earning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.79,0:47:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的收入是多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the newspaper at this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.35,0:47:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一周两镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two pounds a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.95,0:47:49.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}远不及乞讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Far less than begging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.41,0:47:50.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.54,0:47:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去几年我的年平均收入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}During the last few years I had earned,on average,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.15,0:47:54.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最少有七百英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at least seven hundred pounds a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.19,0:47:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这是一名绅士的恶行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's a gentlemen's guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.13,0:47:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静点 布莱斯特里特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calmly Bradstreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.90,0:48:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以很中肯地说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's pertinent to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.02,0:48:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔先生不是名普通的乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Mr. St. Clair is no ordinary beggar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.10,0:48:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人们不会料到一个乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People do not expect a beggar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.47,0:48:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能大量引用莎士比亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to quote extensively from Shakespeare,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.11,0:48:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}狄更斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Dickens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.42,0:48:11.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Bible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.50,0:48:13.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者最流行的乐曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the latest popular songs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.75,0:48:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乞丐王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An aristocrat among beggars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.26,0:48:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道我不该如此说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it is not for me to claim such a distinction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.65,0:48:23.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但正如巡官观察所得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but as the Inspector rightly observes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.98,0:48:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一份体面的收入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a gentlemen's income{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.46,0:48:28.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此如绅士般生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I proceeded to live like a gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.21,0:48:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在肯特郡买了栋别墅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bought a villa in Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.63,0:48:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}娶了一位漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I married a beautiful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.03,0:48:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有身份的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and respectable woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.99,0:48:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and every morning I traveled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.57,0:48:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我进城"上班"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to my business in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.32,0:48:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此时你肯定和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have been embroiled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.89,0:48:43.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}印度人混熟了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the lascar by this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.78,0:48:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了使用他楼上的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I paid him a generous rent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.75,0:48:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我支付了一大笔租金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the use of his upstairs rooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.97,0:48:49.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会守口如瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My secret was safe with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.21,0:48:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我与窃贼为伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fell among thieves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.21,0:48:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却在他们中发现信誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but found honor of a sort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.99,0:48:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天早晨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see every morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.90,0:49:01.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我化妆成肮脏的乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would emerge as a squalid beggar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.46,0:49:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每天晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and every evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.57,0:49:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又换上体面的服装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}transformed into a gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.69,0:49:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我们说说星期一的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us about Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.64,0:49:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那天乞讨结束后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had finished for the day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.17,0:49:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在鸦片馆楼上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was dressing in my room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.53,0:49:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房间里更衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}above the opium den{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.51,0:49:19.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}突然我看出窗外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and suddenly I looked out of the window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.03,0:49:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我恐惧和吃惊的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to my horror and astonishment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.96,0:49:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我妻子在街上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was my wife in the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.57,0:49:29.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她目不转睛地看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her eyes fixed full upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.58,0:49:30.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neville!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.87,0:49:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我赶紧去找那个印度人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ran along to try and find lascar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.26,0:49:38.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能让她进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not let her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.29,0:49:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会告诉她楼上没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say there is nobody upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.89,0:49:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可能会带警察来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She may return with the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.18,0:49:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会告诉他们楼上没人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell them there's nobody upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.26,0:49:45.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布恩先生在楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Boone will be upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.03,0:49:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布恩先生是位房客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Boone's a lodger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.14,0:49:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有权利待在楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a right to be upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.53,0:49:50.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}内维尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neville!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.13,0:49:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又再次化妆成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I then became Boone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.32,0:49:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乞丐布恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the beggar once more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.79,0:49:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我突然想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then it occurred to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.21,0:49:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警察可能会搜查房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there might be a search of the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.16,0:50:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的衣服可能会出卖我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that my clothes might betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:02.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此我将用于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I picked up my coat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.90,0:50:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}存放我乞讨收入的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which was weighed down with the coins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.62,0:50:05.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皮袋子中的硬币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I had just transferred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.96,0:50:07.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}塞进大衣里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from my leather bag{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.26,0:50:08.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以增加重量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which I carry my takings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对其他衣服我也打算如法炮制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of my clothes would have followed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.29,0:50:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但此时此刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but at that moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.04,0:50:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警察到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the police arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.34,0:50:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}剩下的事你们也知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.15,0:50:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在窗台上发现血迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found blood on the windowsill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.30,0:50:31.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我匆忙打开窗户时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my haste to open the window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.95,0:50:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把自己割伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cut myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.52,0:50:37.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个小伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A minor abrasion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.66,0:50:40.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非你戳我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if you prick me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.22,0:50:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此我因涉嫌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thus I was arrested{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.99,0:50:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀自己而被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on suspicion of having murdered myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.17,0:50:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此你让你妻子极度痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thus you caused your wife much anguish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.23,0:50:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我给她写了封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wrote her a letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.67,0:50:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 而且你让印度人帮你寄出？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And gave it to the lascar to post? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.56,0:50:56.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但却没有寄出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not delivered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.16,0:50:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信昨天才寄到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It arrived yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.43,0:51:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他可能把信交给他的某个水手顾客了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He probably gave it to one of his sailor customers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.81,0:51:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我永远无法原谅自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall never forgive myself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.60,0:51:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让自己的妻子遭受如此痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the agony,which I have inflicted upon my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.16,0:51:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以回家了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I go to her now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.74,0:51:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须提个条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we must impose one condition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.38,0:51:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣克莱尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. St. Clair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.44,0:51:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.41,0:51:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从此不可再化妆成布恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must no be more of you Boone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.89,0:51:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我用最郑重的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear it by the most solemn oath{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.00,0:51:25.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}方式起誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a man can take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.47,0:52:04.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永别了 布恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell sweet Boone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.05,0:52:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿成群的天使们用歌唱抚慰你安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A flight of angels sends me to thy rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.51,0:52:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉·莎士比亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William Shakespeare.{\r}
